# Phase 1 package — reproduce, diagnose, and fix real-host initialization

## Intent

Diagnose the concrete checkout-loaded startup failure before selecting a repair. Build a tight red-capable loop around the real host/runtime path, retain sanitized diagnostics, minimize the causal condition, and turn it into a failing regression. Then make the narrow production correction and prove both exact hosts can initialize independently from a clean production runtime.

This phase does **not** perform the complete root `bun run check` or the full mixed-host control/reload/exit certification; those are later phases. Keep all Effect work on repository-pinned `effect@4.0.0-beta.101` and preserve the verified product parent `c78b5b93` and every ancestor.

