## Non-goals

- Full mixed OpenCode/Pi shared-state/control certification, Pi `/reload`, Pi-exit isolation, or final mixed-session cleanup evidence.
- Protocol, provider/coordinator, transport, host UI, or idle-policy redesign.
- Deleting or replacing an occupied endpoint, weakening mode/UID checks, adding broad sleeps/retries, or falling back to per-host provider ownership.
- Dependency or host-pin changes, documentation/changelog work, release operations, commits, pushes, publication, or PR creation.
